  "scope": "Constructed the maximal signed physical field multiplication operator and proved self-adjointness and its exact L2 domain and graph. Decomposed every transverse linear field under the full dilation/shear into constant and scale coefficients, and constructed Schwartz packets with their polynomial weights. Proved actual longitudinal exponential and inverse half-clock graphs for coefficient-weighted products. Derived exact physical field and field-square outputs on the dense repaired trial family and membership of both outputs in D E, where D=C^(-1/2) and E=exp(L/2). Thus D E Phi and D E Phi^2 have dense natural composition domains for epsilon>0 and |hbar|<=pi*epsilon. Derived three-factor formal adjointness without commuting factors, proving Phi E D and Phi^2 E D densely defined and closable. Their constructed graph closures preserve every original action and have dense domains. The closed clock, all transverse momentum/clock, exponential/clock and both matter factors share a proved dense physical domain. Hilbert density is not a joint graph-core theorem or an identification of the joint form closure with the intersection of individual closure domains. The full Hamiltonian form, charge averaging, physical evolution, finite-to-infinite identification, controlled limits, physical identification and the TOE remain open."
}
